⚗ DramaBox Telegram Bot — Main Entry
# kevlang-pure v2.1.0

📦 "grammy" ⊢ (Bot)
📦 "./config.kev" ⊢ (TOKEN)
📦 "./handlers.kev" ⊢ (handleStart, handleText, handleCallback)

bot ← 🧫 Bot(TOKEN)

bot.command("start", ƒ(ctx) → {
  handleStart(ctx)
})

bot.on("message:text", ƒ(ctx) → {
  handleText(ctx)
})

bot.on("callback_query:data", ƒ(ctx) → {
  handleCallback(ctx)
})

bot.catch(ƒ(err) → {
  → "🧪 Bot error: " ⊕ err.message
})

→ "🧪 Bot is running on kevlang-pure v2.1.0..."
bot.start()
